{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_191_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_191","textTraditional":"一、十年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_191_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_191","textTraditional":"二、夏，齊欒施來奔。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_191_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_191","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月，季孫意如、叔弓、仲孫貜帥師伐莒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_191_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_191","textTraditional":"四、戊子，晉侯彪卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_191_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_191","textTraditional":"五、九月，叔孫婼如晉，葬晉平公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_191_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_191","textTraditional":"六、十有二月，甲子，宋公成卒。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}